; A device that is lost a third time ends the program with an error: the first two losses are made good again, the third is
; not. Needs a window and a GPU, so it is only run where the tests with those are.
; Expect: lost 3 times.*graphics driver keeps failing

SetEnv "BLITZLLVM_SIMULATE_DEVICE_LOSS", "2,4,6"
Graphics 64, 48, 32, 2
SetBuffer BackBuffer()
For i = 1 To 3
	Flip
Next
If GraphicsLost() = 0 Then RuntimeError("The first loss was not made good again.")
Flip ; The 4th Flip loses it the second time.
If GraphicsLost() = 0 Then RuntimeError("The second loss was not made good again.")
Flip
Flip ; The 6th Flip is the third loss.
RuntimeError "The third loss did not end the program."
